### Get Users List
# This request retrieves a list of users from the service by hitting the users endpoint.

GET {{host}}/api/v1/users?page=1&limit=2
Accept: application/json

### Create User
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Luke Skywalker",
  "email": "luke.skywalker@example.com"
}

### Get User
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/1
Accept: application/json

### Replace User
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leia Organa",
  "email": "leia.organa@example.com"
}

### Delete User
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/users/1
